%% SAI query flow (Cassandra 5.0; includes vector path)
%% Alt: Dispatcher routes to numeric/text/vector SAI; candidates validated via base read path
%% Cap: SAI returns candidate primary keys; base SSTable read path materializes rows
flowchart LR
  Q[Query (range/text/vector)] --> D[SAI Dispatcher]
  D --> N[Numeric Range Reader]
  D --> X[Text Term/Prefix Reader]
  D --> V[Vector Similarity Reader]

  N --> C1[Candidate PKs]
  X --> C2[Candidate PKs]
  V --> C3[Candidate PKs]

  C1 --> M[Merge/Dedup]
  C2 --> M
  C3 --> M

  subgraph BaseRead[Base SSTable Read Path]
    B1[Bloom Filter]
    B2[Index & Summary]
    B3[Data.db Fetch]
  end

  M --> B1 --> B2 --> B3 --> R[Result Rows]
